WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
And that's halfway already.

2
00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.240
Just keep it going.

3
00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.880
We're almost done.

4
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:09.880
Five seconds left.

5
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:13.400
We're switching to high knees next.

6
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.400
And switch it.

7
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:24.000
Get those knees going.

8
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.480
And that is halfway right there.

9
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:26.960
Keep those knees moving.

10
00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.720
We're almost done.

11
00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:30.720
Five seconds left.

12
00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:33.840
We're switching to burpees next.

13
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.600
And switch it.

14
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:36.960
Drop down into that push-up position.

15
00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:37.960
Get back up.

16
00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:38.960
Do that jump.

17
00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:46.000
Right back down into that push-up position again.

18
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.440
And that is halfway again.

19
00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:48.440
Keep those burpees going.

20
00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:52.320
We've got just a few more seconds before we switch off to that last exercise before we

21
00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:53.320
get that rest.

22
00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:55.840
We're doing jumping jacks.

23
00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:57.120
And start them up.

24
00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.920
Watch over those jumping jacks, get those arms and legs moving.

25
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:00.760
We're almost done.
